<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n74138" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀνομ-αστός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, in dialects <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀνῠμ-</span></b> 
		<i><span class="en">
			Pi.
			<u>P.</u>
			1.38
		</span></i> (as pr. n. of a Delphian, <i><span class="en">
			<u>Berl.Sitzb.</u>
			1927.158
		</span></i> (<span class="entity">Cyrene</span>)):—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>named, to be named,</i> and <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐκ ὀνομαστός</span>
			<i>not to be named</i> or <i>mentioned,</i> i.e. <i>abominable,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Κακοΐλιον οὐκ ὀνομαστήν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					19.260
				</span></i>
			,<i><span class="en">
				597
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Hes.
				<u>Th.</u>
				148
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>of name</i> or <i>note, famous,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Thgn.
				23
			</span></i>, Pi.l.c., <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				4.47
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Isoc.
				12.261
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Phoen.
				2.11
			</span></i>, etc. : 
				Comp.
			 and 
				Sup.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				6.126
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				2.178
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> of things,
				<i>notable,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀνομαστὰ πράσσων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>HF</u>
					509
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
